+mesh's first render (static BVH baking, pinned Cycles behaviour); a Cycles device
+error is permanent for the host; the WebGPU device writes only Combined, only
+supports the perspective camera and needs the integrator's denoising, adaptive
+sampling, guiding and light tree switched off. On this Linux Intel Mesa driver,
+compiling `shade_surface_light` for a spot light after a point light in one
+device lifetime crashed the driver compiler (reported, not worked around; the
+GPU ABI test renders only the point light).
